  "description": "Joo Ihyeon, the sole heir of the Juseong Group, presents as a recessive Omega on the very day his father—the company's chairman—goes missing.\nDetermined to keep his secondary gender a secret for the rest of his life, Ihyeon turns to Junseong, his personal secretary who has been by his side since childhood. He urges Junseong, an Alpha, to help him conceive a child.\nBut their relationship begins to develop in ways neither of them expected.\nThen another Alpha, Haewon, enters the picture, making an already complicated situation even more tangled.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078471)",
